OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWet and
OL,6,Fwindy in the south this evening with
OL,7,Fheavy rain pushing northwards
OL,8,Fovernight for Wales, northern England
OL,9,Fand southern Scotland. Rain turning to
OL,10,Fhill snow in the north, accompanied by
OL,11,Fgales. Clearer to the south later with
OL,12,Fblustery showers.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTuesday:FCold and windy with rain and
OL,15,Fmorning hill snow across the north,
OL,16,Fthough far northern Scotland will be
OL,17,Fbrighter and showery. Heavy, possibly
OL,18,Fthundery showers in the south.
